<gpx version="1.1" creator="Claude Bruce Trail planner" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Day 71 - Jack Poste, Hopeness, Don Irish</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.926582" lon="-81.155865"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking at the south end of Cathedral Dr</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.936950" lon="-81.161112"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed Hopeness Side Trail, heading north. (the blue-blazed Hopeness Side Trail goes off on your right.) This is a short excursion (about 1010 m in all): walk the whole Hopeness Side Trail, including the short loop or branch near its end (see the map), and come back to this junction.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.934972" lon="-81.138269"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Continue straight onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading south-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off behind you.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.918716" lon="-81.151330"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn sharp right onto the blue-blazed Don Irish Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.919677" lon="-81.152777"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Jack Poste Side Trail, heading south. (the blue-blazed Jack Poste Side Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.912300" lon="-81.162741"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turnaround point. The side trail meets the white-blazed main Bruce Trail here. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
